window.products.push({"id":737009,"name":"Sweese 3120 Porcelain Butter Keeper Crock - French Butter Dish - No More Hard Butter - Perfect Spreadable Consistency - Wave Point","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513QDRWl9zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Top 4 Reasons Why the Sweese BUTTER CROCK IS LOVED by Butter Lovers! Unlike other butter trays that you may have used, which make a mess, our Sweese Butter Crock serves the butter easily, and it allows you to have FRESH and SOFT butter for your toast and bread. It's a beautiful addition to your daily table, and your guests even don't tell it is a butter keeper on the table, that makes it a conversation piece for your guest table. With the Sweese Butter Crock, no more transferring butter dish from kitchen or fridge to the dining room back and forth. A wide range of beautiful patterns out there for you to choose from, which can match your dinnerware perfectly. Storing and Serving Fresh Butter Made Easy 3 Easy Steps to use the Sweese Butter Crock Step 1 - Wash the crock thoroughly and make sure the bell is dry, pour cold water into the base of the crock. Step 2 - Press one stick of softened butter (or 1 and 1/3 stick) into the bell with the back of a spoon. Step 3 - Place the bell into the bottom of crock. Enjoy your fresh butter. Tricks & Tips Adding a little salt or vinegar to the water is helpful to keep fresh, while it doesn't affect the taste of the butter either. Refresh your water every 2-13 days and this could be part of your morning routine. Always keep the crock away from heat. The crock works best with real butter instead of margarine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513QDRWl9zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweese","source_asin":"B07H31NRMZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H31NRMZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H31NRMZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
