window.products.push({"id":737145,"name":"Glaciart One Wool Felt Ball Garland - Pom Pom Garland - 9 Feet, 40 Balls, 4 Monochrome Colors, Pom Pom Decorations, Nursery Decor, Bunting, Birthday P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CIeIPtypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wool Imported 100% SHEEP WOOL FROM NEW ZEALAND – Entirely handmade, this happy, nursery garland is made of the plumpest 100% New Zealand wool felt balls. Each puffy, felt balls measure a generous 2cm (3/4inch) perfect for any kind of crafty, whimsical décor. SWEET AND PLAYFUL 9FT POM POM DECORATIONS – To create a masterpiece, you need to add the perfect finishing touch! This 9ft pom pom garland adds a playful, yet magical touch to your décor. Ideal for a nursery, kid’s room, bedroom or playroom, work area, photo backdrop, a reading nook, or baby shower! TANGLE FREE – EASY TO HANG – No need to spend hours untangling this colorful party garland, because we’ve done all the work for you! When you open the package, you’ll find the felted wool balls strung on a soft white thread, FREE of any tangles. While, the ends are finished with small loops to make it easy to hang on a nail or hook. CUSTOMIZABLE ROOM DECOR – Glaciart One has made sure there are NO knots in this felt garland string. You can customize spacing of these felt craft balls with a gentle tug and move them up and down the string. These felt balls will stay in place without any knots! 40 BALLS, 4 COLORS, POM POM BANNER LIFETIME GUARANTEE - A Shabby Chic nursery color will be on its way, as soon as you \"Click Buy Now”. Glaciart One Guarantees that you’ll get 40 wool balls on a 9 ft string, in 4 beautiful colors (exactly as the picture shows)! Time to add some sweet whimsy to your space today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CIeIPtypL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Glaciart One","source_asin":"B09S6P3WWG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S6P3WWG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S6P3WWG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
