window.products.push({"id":737147,"name":"Round Banneton Proofing Basket Set with Cloth Liner and Scraper 9 Inch Professional Bread Proving Bowl Durable Premium Quality Handmade Unbleached Hea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LnTsJcHgL._AC_SL1083_.jpg","description":"9 inch Round banneton Bread Proofing Basket With Linen Liner and Dough Scraper Each banneton is made of unbleached natural rattan cane and is free of any harmful chemicals to ensure you and your family can enjoy safe, healthy homemade bread. Product Features: Our Liners are made of coloring-free, odor-free natural linen.  Our food-grade banneton basket is made of beautifully crafted natural rattan with strict inspection at every single step to ensure each bread proofing basket is splinter-free and of premium quality.  We know the magic of a homemade artisan bread and that is why we strive to produce exceptional quality bread proofing basket.  Our banneton designed to last.  A Bread Basket that is handmade & handcrafted.  A Cloth Liner that is detachable & hand washable.  The handmade basket is made of unbleached natural rattan cane that is food-safe, non-toxic, & eco-friendly, so it is durable & will last for years. Why to use: A proofing based is used for shaping bread dough. You should consider lining the inside of the basket with the liner included in the set or, you can apply flour to it for keeping the extent of the stickiness at a minimal. Easy to clean: The proofing basket is easy to clean. One can simply use the dough scraper (included in the set) to remove the excessive dough from the banneton. Alternatively, you can gently scrub off dough residual using warm water. Easy to maintain: Bannetons are considerably easy to maintain. You can simply scrub and wash your basket, and allow it to dry. Once it is completely dry then, you can store it in a ventilated space. Package Included: 1 x Banneton proofing basket 1 x Cloth linen 1 x Scraper","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LnTsJcHgL._AC_SL1083_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAM Supply","source_asin":"B07PG317N5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PG317N5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PG317N5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
