window.products.push({"id":737261,"name":"Chinese Ceramic Kung Fu Tea Set Purple Clay Tea Set With Wood Tea Tray Household Atomized Running Water Tea Sets (Color : C)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gr2J+PDDL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Use & MaintenanceThey are meant for use with black and oolong teas, green or white tea as well as aged pu¡¯er tea, but the water must be allowed to cool to around 85 ¡ãC (185 ¡ãF) before pouring the water into the pot.The using steps as follow:1. When use the teapot at the first time, put the teapot into clean pot with cold water and boiling for about 5-10 minutes. Then remove the pot from the boiling water and set aside for natural cooling. This step can open the pores of teapot and make the tea more breathable.2. Please put the tea into the Zisha pot and brew with warm water around 185 ¡ãF ,wait for some minutes to enjoy your tea either by pouring it into a cup or by drinking directly from the Zisha teapot, which is the traditional way of using it.Teapots absorb a tiny amount of tea into the pot during brewing. After prolonged use, the pot will develop a coating that retains the flavor and color of the tea. It should be rinsed with fresh water and allowed to air-dry. A studious tea connoisseur will only steep one type of tea in a particular pot, so as not to corrupt the flavor that has been absorbed.(NOTE: FORBIDDEN IN MICROWAVE ,OVEN OR DISHWASHER)Package Include: 1 x Tea SetNote:1. The travel tea set is a normal size for traditional kung fu tea ceremony, not a toy. All Chinese kung fu tea sets are all made in this small size. This size is different from the coffee cup to fill hunger, Chinese kung fu tea cultural is for tasting, relaxing and relieving stress.2. There are some small flaws in the production, such as small black spots, small bubbles and so on, it's inevitable because of firing technology.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Gr2J+PDDL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMYAL","source_asin":"B08P4288J8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P4288J8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P4288J8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
