window.products.push({"id":737332,"name":"EZOWare Bamboo Desk Multifunctional Make up Tray Drawer Storage Organizer For Bathroom Countertop Beauty Products, Hair Care, Make Up, and More","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619dtrx4PPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"[ BEST ORGANIZATION ] The EZOWare Bamboo Wood Make-up Drawer Chest offers an attractive solution to keep rooms and personal areas clear and organized with top visible storage for beauty supplies, jewelry, stationery, and other items. Dimensions: 15.4 x 10.4 x 6.3 inches. [ SPACIOUS DESIGN ] Large cosmetics make-up organizer with open divided top. Allows for easy visibility, display, and access to items. Single large easy-glide divided drawer for convenience. The drawer slides completely out for better organization or to move and use as a portable tray. [ FITS MOST ITEMS ] The top caddy storage has added depth to securely hold bulkier items such as brushes, combs, hair care products, beauty accessories, or even stationary & mail. Comes with a movable pen holder you can move and use for thinner brushes, pens, or pencils. [ DIVIDED DRAWER ] Has 4 divided spaces for easier organization. Great capacity to easily store and access all your lipsticks, eyebrow pencil, eyeliner, blush, mascara, nail polishes, blending brushes, applicators, palettes, hair clips & ties, rings, necklaces, and other beauty or personal products. [ PERFECT FOR ANY ROOM ] Use in bathrooms, on vanities, dressers, for office supplies storage, crafting supply storage, art supply storage, kids room organization & more. The natural neutral wood will match the decor and style of most rooms, office, or home office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619dtrx4PPL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EZOWare","source_asin":"B07GFSPMS1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GFSPMS1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GFSPMS1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737333,"name":"PASSENGER PIGEON Cordless Blackout Window Shades, Premium UV Protection Water Proof Custom Roller Blinds, Printed Picture Window Roller Shade，27\" W x ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NnGHEG71L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 1/4\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 2.5inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2.5inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number deduct 1/4inch as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 6-10inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 5-10inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Printing roller shade. Feature: Blackout Material: Polyester Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NnGHEG71L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B07KTPMXXY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737333","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KTPMXXY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KTPMXXY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737334,"name":"Telescope Casual Easy In and Out High Back Folding Beach Arm Chair, Cabana Green/White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZHzRKlixL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Telescope Casual features a versatile patio furniture collection that consists of a variety of different styles and materials. Since 1903, Telescope Casual has been manufacturing world-class luxury patio furniture that is made in the USA. From their manufacturing plant located in New York, Telescope is constantly improving in the research, development, and engineering process of making quality outdoor furniture. Telescope remains committed to being an industry pioneer by introducing new innovations and products, while preserving their well deserved reputation for high quality furniture. This beach chair features a 20-inch seat height that makes it easier to get in and out of on the beach sand. This chair was design with tall people or for those that have knee or back problems. The chair is foldable, so that you can take it with you to the beach, camping, on the boat, or to a concert. This chair features decorative kiln-dried solid hardwood arms that are shaped and hand sanded and then double coated with heavy-duty polyurethane varnish. The strong 1-inch aluminum frame has been extruded and drawn for extra strength and is assembled using zinc-plated rivets and screws. The beach chair fabric is weather resistant and securely attached using zinc plated nails. The additional canopy top and convenient storage side bag options will match the fabric of the chair if purchased separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZHzRKlixL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Telescope Casual","source_asin":"B007H5GQIG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737334","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007H5GQIG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007H5GQIG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737335,"name":"Tumbler Lid for 30 Oz Yeti Rambler, Old Style RTIC, Ozark Trails and more Cooler Cup, Sliding Splash Proof and Straw Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x-7h8-nUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FIT: The lids can replace 30 oz YETI rambler lids, Ozark Trails tumbler lids and any other 30 oz vacuum insulated stainless steel tumblers cup lid. Not fit NEW design RTIC tumbler! PLEASE REFER TO THE DESCRIPTION DETAIL! Easy TO USE: Contoured sip hole allows for direct sipping or for use with a straw BPA FREE MATERIAL: Made of AS crystal clear plastic which is BPA free, crafted from durable plastic that is long lasting, easy to clean, dishwasher safe. USEFUL REPLACEMENT LIDS: Sliding sip hole cover helps prevents spills and keep your drink insulated longer","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x-7h8-nUL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Colorful PoPo","source_asin":"B01N4D3OXJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4D3OXJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4D3OXJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737336,"name":"lris Bedding Wolf Comforter Set Animal Print Wolves King Bedding 3 Piece Comfortable Comforter with 2 Pillow Shams Home Bedding Sets (B02, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P4w3HBKFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The perfect bedding shouldn’t just give you a better night sleep, it should also match your home décor seamlessly. The perfect combination of functionality and comfort, with striking unique designs, our comforter sets truly are the bedding of your dreams! Made from the highest quality polyester and 3D printed with the latest technology, the comforter and pillow shams set will completely transform your bedroom, and help you sleep as a baby!  What makes our bedding so unique? We strived to create the most comfortable bedding possible. Using high-quality microfiber polyester, the comforter and shams are ultra-soft and comfortable. The comforter is also incredibly breathable and lightweight so you get a truly remarkable sleeping experience. Some of the amazing features of our comforter set: ?Durability, the comforter and shams are rip and tear proof, made with reinforced stitching to provide extended durability; ?Unique designs, we offer a wide selection of 3D printed designs, featuring vivid colors that are guaranteed not to fade; ?Reversible, the comforter is reversible so you can easily change your room décor; ?Easy to care for, the bedding is machine-washable and wrinkle-resistant; ?Range of sizes: -Twin (66x86’’) – 1 pillowcase (20x30’’) -Queen-size (90x90’’) – 2 pillowcases (20x30’’) -King-size (104x90’’) – 2 pillowcases (20x36’’) Completely transform your bedroom and sleeping experience!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71P4w3HBKFL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"lris Bedding","source_asin":"B097NW32G3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097NW32G3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097NW32G3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
