window.products.push({"id":737409,"name":"Saffron Marigold Midnight Lotus ~ Unique Asian Floral Blue Fabric Shower Curtain 72x72","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91maunDxTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lotus blossoms and water were made for each other so a Midnight Lotus shower curtain would be a natural fit in your bath. For stunning impact consider painting a mural on a wall, much like Monet's Waterliles. For a gentler approach, accent the bath with deep blue tiles, white bath linens and lotus flower candles and the effect will be just as striking. The shower curtain is 72 inches wide and 72 inches long. Each shower curtain is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and is exquisitely finished with twelve neat buttonhole openings for easy hanging. Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. About Midnight Lotus: Envision a lotus pond at midnight replete with ethereal white lotus blossoms, sinuously intertwined, floating gently on deep cobalt blue waters. The lotus enjoys rich material and spiritual symbolism in Indias arts, religions and systems of thought. The lotus, in which the gods discovered their grace and majesty; artists the subtlest expression of beauty; and mystics, dimensions of mysticism and intricate cosmic existence; is the primary flower of India. Since the lotus blooms from the underworld into light, the lotus motif is symbolically associated with transcending of mans spirit over worldly matters.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91maunDxTqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B01CNHS6QM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737409","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CNHS6QM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CNHS6QM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737410,"name":"Ubrand Iron Sculpture Accent Piece, Gift for Readers, Teachers, and More, Old-Fashioned Decorative Object for Home, Office, Table and Desktop Decor 7x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sHAkTKyfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"For any avid book collector, voracious reader, or book loving family, Encircled Reader iron sculpture is a perfect addition to their home or office. This beautifully abstract statue depicts a slender figure reclining slightly in an iron circle while reading. The abstract nature of this statue allows its viewers to identify with it on multiple levels and inspires a love of reading in children and adults alike. Although the statue inspires a sense of elegance in its form and construction, it also adds a fun and cute flair to any room you choose to place it in. This sculpture inspires a sort of old-fashioned vibe with its dark brown sheen on the iron. Each of these unique sculptures is carefully made by hand using a sand casting method.  Each sculpture weighs 2.51 pounds and measures 6.5 inches wide, 3.5 inches deep, and 7.5 inches high. With this small size and durable weight, this sculpture easily fits most tables, shelves, or desks. The finish on this piece is a classic dark brown, making it tarnish-proof. Simply place the statue anywhere you please, and you’re all set for a beautiful display.  This simply elegant statue is great for any room in the house where books are kept, like the family reading room, office, bedroom, nursery, or reading nook. From its intricate detailing to its beautiful finish,iron sculpture is a great addition to any home, office, or library to add a new bit of class and old-fashioned sophistication wherever you decide to place it. Features - Color: Brown. - Material: Cast Iron. - Size: About 16.5 * 8.3 * 19.1cm. Package Including 1 x desktop ornament","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sHAkTKyfL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ubrand","source_asin":"B08R1QLDGG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737410","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R1QLDGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R1QLDGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
