window.products.push({"id":737417,"name":"Pur UV Powerful Light, 55W Livingroom Bedroom Germ Virus, Dustmite Eliminator Kill 99.9% Mold Bacteria Germs Dustmite Virus Help Reduce Allergy from D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31FN-YMc9nL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is the new generation improved circuit, which is much more stable and durable. Specifications: Material: Fired-proof ABS base, Stainless Steel holder Color: Silver and Black Voltage: 110V  Power: 55W UV Lamp: 254nm Wavelength Remote Controller: 23A Battery *1 (included) Fits For: Room Area About 650 SQF, only need 15 minutes Size: 8.6” x 8.2\" x 29.1\"  Bulb Length: 20.87\"  Features: Powerful and 360°solution [Sterilization Area]: up to 650 SQF effectiveness in a single use. [Sterilization Time]: 30/60/120 minutes [Surface Sterilization]: Put the target within 1-meter distance from the device. 30-minute irradiation is recommended for efficient surface sterilization. [Automatic]: It will automatically turn off after sterilization. How to use: Direct Control：  1.Press the general power red button on the back of the panel, the ON/OFF light is on.  2.Then press the timing you want: 30 mins, 60 mins, 120 mins. It will start in 60 seconds automatically! Leave the room now!   Remote control:  1.Press the general power red button on the back of the panel, the ON/OFF light is on.  2.Then press the timing on the remote control: 30 mins, 60 mins, 120 mins outside your door. (3 meters of control distance, can be remote-controlled through the wall and door)   Please feel free to contact us by email if there is any problem with our products and we will reply and give satisfied solution within 24 hours.   The smell after sterilization is lower than 0.2mg/m³ , so it is not harmful to human body.  It is some kind of taste of decomposition of bacteria such as mites.  So no other protection is needed, but if you feel it is strong, we recommend opening the window and door for 10-15 minutes after sterilization.  Thanks. If you have any questions on our products, pls feel free to contact us and we promise a reply within 24 hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31FN-YMc9nL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pur UV","source_asin":"B07FMS2W2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FMS2W2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FMS2W2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
