window.products.push({"id":737584,"name":"YOSICHY Table Mats Set of 6 Crossweave Woven Vinyl Placemats Heat Resistant Non-Slip Kitchen Placemats for Dining Table Washable Easy to Clean(Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7195L-sGYDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These place mats feature a chic, elegant style with the woven background and grey stripes design. Put your best dinnerware under these vinyl place mats,it will elevates the look of any table setting, improving your dining experience and impress your guest! Product Features: 1.Placemats are weaved out of PVC fiber, they are NOT water tight and NOT totally spill proof. 2.Heat resistant and durable: Highest heat-resisting temperature can amount to 200°F. 3.Packaged flat, would lay flat on the table and reliable out of shape. 4.The placemats is hand cut , there will be 0.5cm Error, this would not affect use. Usage Range: 1.Placed under cups, tablewares, vases and ashtrays as decoration to your dining tables and tea tables. 2.Used as placemats,coasters,potholders and heat pads on dining tables,tea tables and pianos. 3.Home, hotel and business offices, conference tables, kitchen tables. 4.Indoor for home, hotel, business offices, conference table or kitchen table, outdoor for wedding, party or BBQ event. Care Instructions: 1.DO NOT use it exceed the temperature. 2.Cleaned with water and dry under the shade. 3.No machine wash or disinfected with microwaves. 4.No more, washed repeatedly. 5.Easy clean with wet cloth or rinse with little cleaner would make them look as new. Satisfaction Guaranteed: YOSICHY make sure you receive the high quality placemats as well as customer-satisfying service .If you’re not completely satisfied, we’ll make it right or your money back. 100% satisfaction guarantee is offered here.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7195L-sGYDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOSICHY","source_asin":"B07HQ9SSZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HQ9SSZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HQ9SSZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737585,"name":"NSpired Ink Framed One Day When My Children are Grown Canvas Wall Decor. Many Framing Options Available (20X24)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"Nspired Ink is dedicated to bringing you custom home decor designed to bring added elegance, beauty and in some cases a little humor. With many offerings geared towards Children, Parents, Grandparents Memorial Occasions and many more. Each item is hand crafted to ensure that the quality of this print does not falter and will provide years of happiness to any room. This specific canvas is meant to remind us everyday that our children will always be welcome in our homes stating, \"One day, when my children are grown, I hope they still come through he front door without knocking. I hope they head to the kitchen for a snack and slump on the sofa to watch TV. I hope they come in and feel the weight of adulthood leave them for they are home. For my children, my door will forever be open.\" The frames are all build in house to fit each print perfectly. We use wood cut in the United States, canvases from a local distributor and print them all in house. The canvas will be sized based on your selection and the frame added around the canvas. No mounting hardware is included as there are far to many ways to mount these. Our customers love these prints, we know you will too. If you have questions regarding this print or any of the other prints we offer, please let us know and we will answer ASAP!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nspired Ink","source_asin":"B07QQTN116","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QQTN116","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QQTN116","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
