window.products.push({"id":737637,"name":"Original Painting By Philo of This Pembroke Welsh Corgi on Haute Couture Luggage 11x14 Fine Art Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LlcB0YF9L._AC_SL1292_.jpg","description":"Fine art Giclee print of an adorable Corgi resting on vintage Louis Vuitton Luggage. This is an 11x14 inch piece on heavy weight fine art paper.SAN FRANCISCO BAY AREA ARTIST \"PHILO\" OFFERS PAINTINGS OF THIS ADORABLE CORGI READY FOR YOU TO FRAME. THIS IS A FINE ART PIECE DIRECT FROM PHILO AT ITS A DOGS LIFE STUDIO. EACH ONE IS HAND SIGNED. Artist Credentials Full-time professional artist working in watercolor, acrylic and oils. My artwork has graced the cover of numerous catalogs in addition to being in private collections in the United States and Internationally. Artist Style Described as Realistic Impressionism, paintings with classic vivid colors, great attention to detail. Capturing the whimsical attitudes of her subjects. Giclee prints are just beautiful. It is taking the original painting and scanning it. Then through the magic of the digital age, no halftone screens are used so you get a very high resolution image. The fine spraying of the inks and the highest quality fine art paper, makes for an incredible reproduction. It looks just like the original painting. The colors are fantastic. This is an archival process to last over 100 years. Like all Art Work it is best to avoid direct sunlight. Your original Philo Painting Giclee Print should give you years of pleasure as well as be a great investment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LlcB0YF9L._AC_SL1292_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"It's a Dogs Life Studio","source_asin":"B004FTA6GA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737637","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004FTA6GA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004FTA6GA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
