window.products.push({"id":737719,"name":"MyGift Clear Glass Apothecary Jars (3 Piece Set) with Bird Lid Design Wedding Candy Buffet Containers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qPeCVk3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Store your favorite snacks in style or create your own decorative displays with these beautiful apothecary jars. This set comes with 3 different jars, each one a different size and shape each accented with bird top lid, the jars are perfect not only for storing candy and other foods in the kitchen but also for displaying a wide variety of decorative items for wedding centerpieces and home decor accents. These clear jars help you add the perfect touch of elegant glass design to your home or party. **Official MyGift product includes microfiber polishing cloth.** Approximate Dimensions (in inches): Tallest Jar - 10.5 H X 4.75 Diameter; Medium Jar - 9.5 H X 5 Diameter; Shortest Jar - 7.75 H X 5.25 Diameter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qPeCVk3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MyGift","source_asin":"B012HQ3LIC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737719","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012HQ3LIC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012HQ3LIC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737720,"name":"Best Choice Products Wooden Bathroom Floor Cabinet w/ 2 Shelves and Drawer Storage Compartment, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZsSz2sAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPACE SAVER: A handsome and convenient way to store linens, toiletries, and other bathroom essentials without sacrificing space VERSATILE STORAGE: Two adjustable shelves and a high-capacity drawer allow you to comfortably and efficiently store a wide variety of bathroom essentials ELEGANT: Beautifully designed with a clean white finish and a ventilated slat door, this cabinet adds style and substance to any bathroom DURABLE: Sturdy, well-built, and versatile this floor cabinet uses medium density fiberboard along with a water seal finish to serve your needs for years to come Overall Dimensions: 18\"(L) x 11.5\"(W) x 35\"(H); Top Panel Capacity: 20 lbs., Inner Shelf Capacity: 10 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZsSz2sAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Best Choice Products","source_asin":"B0798XS6WT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737720","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0798XS6WT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0798XS6WT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737721,"name":"LoveSleepCo. Cooling Sheet Set - Nylon and Polyester Sheet Set, Queen Sized, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TtE5qd91L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"LoveSleepCo. Cooling Sheet Set Utilizing our own technology! Mineral rock infused fibers are what create the cool to the touch sensation What’s included? Great Q. This complete set has everything you need including pillow cases, a flat sheet and a fitted sheet. Our Cooling Series has 135 GSM (Grams per Square Meter) GSM refers to the quality and thickness of the threads. There’s nothing basic about these Cool-to-the-Touch sheet sets. This collection is made with mineral rock infused fibers to keep you cool and comfortable while you sleep . This complete set has everything you need including pillow cases, a flat sheet and a fitted sheet. The Cooling Sheet Set is available in Twin, Full, or Queen. This set is machine washable and quick drying , because you know, life happens.  All of our Cooling Sheets use mineral rock infused threads . Infused mineral rock creates a cooling sensation when in contact with the body, just like how touching metal in the winter always feels cold. Made with a GSM of 135, our cooling sheet sets are going to keep you cooler through the night. A higher GSM means thicker and heavier fabric, LoveSleepCo. uses a relatively low GSM to keep you cool and comfy! Everyone loves a good bedtime story and here is ours- We love our sleep, and it’s proven by science that a good night’s sleep contributes to a good mood. We knew if we could make more people feel refreshed and awake, the world would be a happier place. Literally weaving technology with quality materials, LoveSleepCo. poured 30 years of dedicated research into creating the perfect mattress, followed by the entire sleeping experience- sheets, pillows, comforters, oh my! We’re a company with Japanese roots, a strong work ethic and a love for sleep!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TtE5qd91L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LoveSleepCo.","source_asin":"B07DM93S8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737721","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DM93S8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DM93S8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737722,"name":"MaxGear Fridge Organizer Bins Clear Stackable Pantry Organization and Storage Multi-Use Storage Bins with Handles for Refrigerator, Fridge, Freezer, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I7Kdjfz2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional and Versatile: These storage bins measure 10 x 4 x 3 inch with 6 packs. They are great for creating a clean and organized refrigerator or pantry. Ideal for fruit, vegetables, drinks, yogurts, canned goods, meat. You also can use them for storing dry goods in your pantry. Clear and Sturdy: Made of premium BPA free durable PET material, much more sturdy and scratch-resistant than other plastic material. Besides, with clear view, you can easily find what you have and what you want without having to take the whole bin out of the fridge. Use side by side to create a storage solution that works best for you. Stackable Design: Considerate stackable design allows you to creat your own storage system and save more space in your refrigerators, freezers, cabinets, shelves, or drawers. Built-in Handles: The bins have handle grips on the edge making it easy to carry and access contents. You just take the bins out and get the items you want, then put it back in so simple. Organize all of your kitchen essentials to make organizing and everyday living with ease, creating a clean and organized home. Easy to Clean & After-Sales Service: Please clean these pantry organizers by hand only with mild soap and warm water. These storage bins are NOT dishwasher safe, please do not place in dishwasher. Ps. We provide full refund or free replacement if there are any quality issues. You can easily reach us if there is any question.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I7Kdjfz2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MaxGear","source_asin":"B08TBPMR53","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737722","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TBPMR53","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TBPMR53","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
