window.products.push({"id":737998,"name":"YONHAN Portable Air Conditioner Air Cooler Rechargeable 2000mAh Evaporative Cooling fan with 3 Speeds, Mini AC Personal 100% Leakproof Design for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wBIyKobNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Portable Size: The mini evaporative air cooler is 5.4×6.1×4.9 inch, which is space-saving for your home, office and classroom. Bring you super cool air in hot summer! Compact size for personal space. You can use it in the car or enjoy the coolness while camping. 3 in 1 Function: This multi-functional small air conditioner fan integrates air cooling, spray humidification, and purification functions. No matter where you are, the highly effective personal space cooler can take you away from the hot summer, enjoy your cooling summer. 3 Adjustable Speed: Our air conditioner cordless designed with 3 modes of speed, it can be adjusted (low/medium/high) freely according to your requirements. Also you can adjust wind direction into vertical rotation if you need for various occasions. Energy Saving & Ulter Quiet: This mini air cooler Simply fill with water, rechargeable, plug it into USB port or power bank, with high efficiency at low power of working wattage, it saves your electricity bills and does no harm to the environment. Less than 68dB ultra-quiet operation, it is very suitable for the elderly and sleeping at night. Upgraded filter & Water Tank: The mini air cooler has UV-C purify technology and silver ion purify filter are used in the water tank, which can better remove rubbish in the discharged air and keep it clean. And the top water tank increases the convenience of water filling and reduces water leakage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wBIyKobNS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YONHAN","source_asin":"B0932C7Y6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0932C7Y6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0932C7Y6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":737999,"name":"\"Happy Popcorn\" Design, Paper Popcorn Bags with 8' x 5' Wide Opening, Perfect for Movie Night and Carnival, 1 - 2 Ounce, Case of 200","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814AxhEWeFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for premium quality popcorn bags that are perfect for a party, carnival or movie night etc?   You have come to the right place! At Flying Lion, we have researched, designed and manufactured a popcorn bag that is affordable, of premium quality and has a unique design. It is bound to get you heaps of praises from your popcorn-eaters, especially the kids. Flying Lion's Popcorn Bag Features: Instead of just using kraft paper with no lining, we use grease-proof premium quality paper. This ensures your popcorn bags will not leave greasy stains from your buttery popcorns. Perfect for buttery popcorns like kettle corns and popcorn balls. From our research, we found the right thickness of the paper bag that makes it lightweight and yet still be resilient to tears  The opening size of the popcorn bag is 5\" inch in diameter so that you can easily feed popcorns into the bag  Most popcorn bags on the market are either too small (unsatisfying amount of popcorns) or too large (insufficient amount of popcorns to give around). We have found the sweet spot for the size of popcorn bags. It may look small but this is the rockstar of small popcorn bags. With its pleated side, the popcorn bag is able to open up to 3 inches of breadth and is able to fill up approximately 1 - 2 ounces of popcorns.   With these above features of a well-crafted popcorn bags, we know it's useless if we cannot get it in your hands. Hence, we are pricing the popcorn bags reasonably. We promise that you will be getting much more than what you are paying for. Wanna know more? Check the reviews to see why our customers love us! Number of pieces per unit Popcorn bags are sold in bulk of 200 pieces Packaging Comes in clear polybag with the popcorn bags stacked in 2 flat piles side by side. Convenient for storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814AxhEWeFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flying Lion","source_asin":"B01A51LAVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-737999","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A51LAVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A51LAVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
